    "proof": [
      "Every f in B and v in V=B+Q with fv in R=T+Q has fv in V, by the complete zero-D scan.",
      "For nonzero q in Q, independence modulo T gives V intersect (T+q) = B+q.",
      "Every useful operand plane of U=B+q meets B; Boolean basis changes change its product only by U functions.",
      "Therefore every U product lying in S=T+q already lies in U: U is S-constrained closed.",
      "W is contained in U but AES targets are not. No S-constrained completion from this fixed W exists.",
      "The nine-product replacement budget permits only one independent direction outside T; this proves conditional 27-AND exclusions, not a global AES bound."
    ],
    "scope": "One fixed retained eighteen-AND space and one Q7 span; other auxiliaries and changed retained spaces remain open."
  },
